<p class="MsoHeader"><span></span></p>

</div></div><div class="WordSection45">

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;"><b><i><span style="font-size:8.0pt;line-height:1.347398;;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.05pt;">Wiekowanie należności z tytułu
dostaw i usług</span></i></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;"><b><i><span style="font-size:6.0pt;line-height:1.347398;;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.05pt;"><span> </span></span></i></b></p>

<table class="MsoNormalTable" title="6981367f-0a1e-4da5-9f1c-951a6e63db11" style="border:solid 0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;"><tbody>
 <tr style="height:11.35pt">
  <td style="width:303.3pt;border-top:solid #A6A6A6 1.5pt;border-left:&#xD;&#xA;  none;border-bottom:solid #A6A6A6 1.5pt;border-right:none;background:#FFD243;&#xD;&#xA;  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:11.35pt">
  <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:1.8pt;&#xD;&#xA;  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt;"></span></p>
  </td>
